### 7. Reject or Revoke Provider Approval
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/providers/PROVIDER_ID/approval
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isApproved": false
}

### 8. Get All Bookings (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/bookings
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN



